    <statement><p>Write the fraction as a decimal number.</p>
<p><ol label="a.">
<li>
<p><m>{{\frac{3}{20}}}</m> = <fillin characters="11" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>{{\frac{1}{5}}}</m> = <fillin characters="11" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0.15</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0.2</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>To change a fraction to decimal, we divide the numerator by the denominator.</p>
<p><ol label="a.">
<li>
<p><m>{{\frac{3}{20}}} = 3 \div 20 = 0.15</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>{{\frac{1}{5}}} = 1 \div 5 = 0.2</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</solution>
